<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head><title>Subscribe to Alerts · bitcoin++</title>{{ block "header" . }}{{ end }}
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/static/css/login-layout.css?v=2"></head>
<body class="btcpp-login-page">{{ block "mainnav" . }}{{ end }}
<main class="auth-shell auth-shell--simple"><section class="auth-card">
<header class="auth-card__head"><span class="auth-kicker">BITCOIN++ ALERTS</span><h1>Review your monthly plan</h1><p>Your first three repositories are free. Add {{ .Slots }} more for {{ .Total }} per month.</p></header>
<p>USD, including applicable tax. Renews monthly until canceled. Your selections activate after payment is verified.</p>
<p>Cancel future renewals through billing management. Your paid allowance continues until the current period ends; cancellation does not refund that period.</p>
{{ if .Enabled }}<form method="post" action="/services/alerts/subscribe">
<input type="hidden" name="account" value="{{ .Account }}"><input type="hidden" name="slots" value="{{ .Slots }}"><input type="hidden" name="key" value="{{ .Key }}"><input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="{{ .CSRF }}">
<button type="submit" class="auth-primary">Continue with card · {{ .Total }}/month</button></form>
{{ else }}<p role="status">Card checkout is not configured here yet.</p>{{ end }}
<p><a href="https://alerts.btcpp.dev/terms">Terms</a> · <a href="https://alerts.btcpp.dev/privacy">Privacy</a></p>
<p><a href="https://alerts.btcpp.dev/alerts">Return to My alerts</a></p>
</section></main></body></html>
